## Required Fix

Fix `scripts/sw-code-review-test.sh:33` to use portable sed:

```bash
# Current (broken on Linux):
sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git"

# Should be:
if [[ "$OSTYPE" == "darwin"* ]]; then
    sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git"
else
    sed -i "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git"
fi
```

Once this pre-existing bug is fixed, npm test will pass and the task will be complete.
